WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.080 --> 00:03.650
[This series contains scenes of violence, self-harm, and potential triggers.]

3
00:03.650 --> 00:05.220
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

4
00:39.360 --> 00:46.030
[Some scenes were created with AI.]

5
00:48.160 --> 00:51.980
[Adapted from the webtoon "The Sound of Sugar Cubes" by Kim Tak]

6
00:51.980 --> 00:54.740
[Screenwriter: So-on (JD)]

7
00:54.740 --> 00:57.680
[Director: Yoon Jinyoung]

8
01:14.130 --> 01:15.840
[Yoo Dohyun]

9
01:15.960 --> 01:17.350
[Cho Chanhyeon]

10
01:17.470 --> 01:19.010
[Ko Gyeol]

11
01:20.850 --> 01:23.980
[The Sound of Sugar Cubes]

12
01:29.620 --> 01:31.130
But the problem is,

13
01:31.360 --> 01:34.710
because of that, he always crosses the line

14
01:34.850 --> 01:37.240
and creates trouble.

15
01:40.979 --> 01:43.570
[Where are you?]

16
01:42.220 --> 01:43.420
Where are you?

17
01:48.000 --> 01:51.060
What does it matter to me where he is and what he's doing?

18
02:00.980 --> 02:02.020
Hey, you...

19
02:02.450 --> 02:04.600
Open the door for me.

20
02:10.539 --> 02:12.050
You...

21
02:13.830 --> 02:16.950
Why are you here when you're this hurt? Go to the hospital.

22
02:16.950 --> 02:18.030
I came to see you.

23
02:18.360 --> 02:19.340
What?

24
02:20.040 --> 02:21.650
To see if you're okay.

25
02:21.800 --> 02:24.200
I have to see it with my own eyes to be at ease.

26
02:29.360 --> 02:30.790
Can you still walk?

27
02:35.230 --> 02:36.829
This feels more stable.

28
02:37.630 --> 02:39.310
I guess you're not that hurt.

29
02:46.530 --> 02:49.460
Keep your voice down. If Mr. Pan wakes up, we're dead.

30
02:50.970 --> 02:52.460
Die, Lee Won, die!

31
02:52.650 --> 02:53.880
Go to hell!

32
02:55.100 --> 02:56.600
I'm so scared.

33
02:57.290 --> 02:58.730
I don't want to die.

34
03:06.200 --> 03:07.460
Smile.

35
03:08.630 --> 03:09.830
Did you

36
03:10.000 --> 03:11.780
end up like this because of me?

37
03:14.100 --> 03:15.340
I'm right, aren't I?

38
03:19.550 --> 03:21.100
Why...

39
03:22.600 --> 03:24.800
Why are you going to such lengths for me?

40
03:30.420 --> 03:31.550
What about you?

41
03:32.829 --> 03:33.810
Huh?

42
03:35.210 --> 03:38.460
Why do you absolutely need to get that song back?

43
03:40.800 --> 03:43.190
I want to at least protect his dream.

44
03:45.030 --> 03:46.860
You do that—protect his dream.

45
03:49.590 --> 03:51.800
I'll protect you and your dream.

46
03:52.530 --> 03:54.060
What are you talking about?

47
03:54.680 --> 03:56.420
You've bled so much.

48
04:03.810 --> 04:05.360
What are all these?

49
04:06.140 --> 04:07.420
Just some

50
04:07.640 --> 04:09.210
old scars?

51
04:09.290 --> 04:10.960
Right, so how did you get them?

52
04:11.520 --> 04:13.190
They're all healed. It's nothing.

53
04:13.190 --> 04:14.300
I'm used to it.

54
04:16.480 --> 04:18.779
No one gets used to getting hurt.

55
04:33.330 --> 04:34.540
Smile.

56
04:35.440 --> 04:36.490
What?

57
04:37.700 --> 04:39.970
Like how you smiled on stage just now.

58
04:39.980 --> 04:41.180
Let me see that smile.

59
04:42.980 --> 04:45.000
You do look ridiculous right now.

60
04:45.340 --> 04:47.320
But I don't smile on demand.

61
04:48.150 --> 04:49.150
Tsk.

62
04:51.770 --> 04:53.030
You heard me sing.

63
04:53.880 --> 04:55.120
How was it?

64
04:56.110 --> 04:57.200
Well,

65
04:57.480 --> 04:58.630
I'm not sure.

66
05:00.350 --> 05:02.800
I wasn't paying attention to your singing.

67
05:02.810 --> 05:05.220
I was too distracted by your pretty face.

68
05:06.490 --> 05:07.760
Don't be stupid.

69
05:11.130 --> 05:12.730
Did you get a concussion too?

70
05:13.300 --> 05:14.290
Ah!

71
05:15.180 --> 05:16.400
No wonder.

72
05:16.590 --> 05:18.780
You look so pretty now too.

73
05:21.300 --> 05:23.470
Be quiet. Mr. Pan is asleep.

74
05:27.290 --> 05:28.900
I told you to be quiet.

75
05:36.290 --> 05:37.690
What are you doing?

76
05:42.830 --> 05:45.950
This is the most effective way to shut me up.

77
05:56.370 --> 05:58.050
Are you out of your mind?

78
05:59.680 --> 06:00.780
Yeah.

79
06:01.490 --> 06:03.090
Don't answer.

80
06:26.790 --> 06:28.010
This is actually better.

81
06:28.010 --> 06:29.230
So thrilling.

82
06:29.610 --> 06:31.160
You're really crazy—

83
06:31.730 --> 06:32.920
Stay quiet,

84
06:33.170 --> 06:34.380
or we'll get caught.

85
06:46.470 --> 06:47.550
Hanyul.

86
06:48.210 --> 06:49.280
Hanyul.

87
06:50.120 --> 06:51.960
You're doing good, Hanyul.

88
06:52.090 --> 06:53.570
Here, good job.

89
07:53.290 --> 07:54.610
Ugh, damn it.

90
07:59.130 --> 08:00.120
I'm up.

91
08:03.900 --> 08:06.480
Hey, Hanyul! It's time for training.

92
08:07.280 --> 08:08.470
Get it together.

93
08:10.150 --> 08:11.930
Hey, did you sleep...

94
08:16.570 --> 08:18.180
What the hell are you doing

95
08:18.370 --> 08:19.730
in my sacred studio?

96
08:19.950 --> 08:21.120
Get up now!

97
08:28.810 --> 08:30.930
You're supposed to be writing songs,

98
08:31.500 --> 08:34.500
and you, working on your singing. I swear I'm gonna...

99
08:34.890 --> 08:36.150
I'm to blame.

100
08:36.270 --> 08:39.280
If you're going to scold anyone, scold me.

101
08:39.590 --> 08:41.190
He didn't do anything wrong.

102
08:42.409 --> 08:45.300
You've got to be kidding me.

103
08:46.290 --> 08:50.500
I was just a little cold, so I hugged him. That's all.

104
08:50.800 --> 08:53.140
Cold? In this summer heat?

105
08:53.570 --> 08:56.500
Then I was a little hot, so I...

106
08:56.950 --> 08:58.070
Get out.

107
08:58.200 --> 08:59.510
Get out of here!

108
08:59.630 --> 09:00.830
For crying out loud!

109
09:03.630 --> 09:04.830
Pan.

110
09:06.280 --> 09:08.140
I'm too sexy right now.

111
09:15.930 --> 09:17.580
What? You want me to wear this?

112
09:17.580 --> 09:19.510
Wear it and get out!

113
09:19.650 --> 09:21.270
Get lost! Shoo!

114
09:24.710 --> 09:26.020
Is this right?

115
09:29.850 --> 09:31.230
Mr. Pan!

116
09:31.350 --> 09:33.580
What brings you all the way out here?

117
09:36.910 --> 09:38.070
What are you doing?

118
09:38.380 --> 09:39.450
Here.

119
09:39.550 --> 09:40.860
Oh, my shirt?

120
09:50.740 --> 09:51.810
Here.

121
09:52.370 --> 09:53.380
What?

122
09:53.600 --> 09:54.740
Wash it again for me.

123
09:55.070 --> 09:56.240
Why should I?

124
09:57.110 --> 09:58.950
Why can't I take this off?

125
09:59.830 --> 10:01.590
Don't move.

126
10:01.610 --> 10:03.580
Your hair is caught on the button.

127
10:13.340 --> 10:15.020
I'll let you off today.

128
10:30.570 --> 10:31.920
["Sound of Dawn" by Adolph]

129
10:34.150 --> 10:35.810
This is Adolph's sheet music.

130
10:36.020 --> 10:37.600
Why is it with you?

131
10:37.710 --> 10:39.090
I'll give it all to you.

132
10:39.700 --> 10:40.870
Come with me.

133
10:43.320 --> 10:44.720
Just you and me.

134
11:05.620 --> 11:09.350
It's really been a long time since we visited our school, hasn't it?

135
11:09.350 --> 11:11.220
I've always wanted to come back.

136
11:14.650 --> 11:16.220
What about the sheet music?

137
11:17.010 --> 11:18.290
Don't you want it?

138
11:21.930 --> 11:23.390
You're still the same,

139
11:23.840 --> 11:26.000
always putting Adolph before me.

140
11:28.660 --> 11:30.050
Cut the crap.

141
11:30.510 --> 11:32.490
Where's the rest of his sheet music?

142
11:32.490 --> 11:35.260
Probably at... my house.

143
11:35.720 --> 11:37.250
Unbelievable.

144
11:39.700 --> 11:42.190
I'll give you one page every time we meet.

145
11:44.270 --> 11:45.580
Sound of Dawn...

146
11:49.210 --> 11:51.830
Why did you release Adolph's song as your own?

147
11:52.840 --> 11:55.780
I thought it might bring you to me.

148
11:57.130 --> 11:58.590
You're telling me

149
11:58.860 --> 12:00.360
you stole Adolph's song

150
12:01.240 --> 12:02.830
just to bait me?

151
12:03.060 --> 12:04.680
To me, it wasn't bait.

152
12:05.220 --> 12:06.330
What?

153
12:07.080 --> 12:08.400
It was a path,

154
12:09.430 --> 12:11.630
a path for you to come back to me.

155
12:14.250 --> 12:16.140
This is making me sick.

156
12:16.760 --> 12:18.700
Those memories with you

157
12:18.960 --> 12:20.960
all make me sick.

158
12:21.450 --> 12:23.380
But do you know what's really sickening?

159
12:23.380 --> 12:27.240
Whenever I miss Adolph and reminisce about him, you're always there.

160
12:27.380 --> 12:30.980
That's why I can't even think about Adolph.

161
12:31.860 --> 12:33.410
Why did you kill him?

162
12:33.990 --> 12:36.050
Why did you kill Adolph?

163
12:36.560 --> 12:38.320
You're saying...

164
12:38.670 --> 12:40.240
I killed him?

165
12:40.360 --> 12:41.850
You did.

166
12:42.800 --> 12:44.470
No, Hanyul.

167
12:44.790 --> 12:46.250
Then what is it?

168
12:46.650 --> 12:48.140
Tell me!

169
12:53.550 --> 12:54.720
Yo, it's Herod!

170
12:54.740 --> 12:56.400
I've never seen a celebrity before!

171
12:56.400 --> 12:57.920
-I want a selfie! -Take pictures!

172
12:57.920 --> 12:59.050
-Come here. -Me too.

173
12:59.070 --> 13:00.590
Why are you at our school?

174
13:00.800 --> 13:02.090
Herod, let us see your face!

175
13:02.050 --> 13:03.580
[Saebyeok Entertainment: I like your voice. Reach out anytime!]

176
13:02.300 --> 13:03.590
Herod, let us see your face.

177
13:03.590 --> 13:04.700
Wow, so handsome.

178
13:04.940 --> 13:06.680
He's so handsome.

179
13:06.690 --> 13:07.820
Where are you going?

180
13:08.300 --> 13:11.070
Stop at nothing to get what you want.

181
13:15.990 --> 13:19.820
You refused to take over the company and insisted on being an idol,

182
13:16.500 --> 13:18.260
[Y-route takes second place on this week's music show]

183
13:19.850 --> 13:22.010
but you can't even get first place?

184
13:23.470 --> 13:25.690
Pathetic.

185
13:32.120 --> 13:33.350
Is it taken care of?

186
13:35.000 --> 13:36.900
Make sure there are no loose ends.

187
13:36.900 --> 13:38.990
We don't need any rumors spreading.

188
13:50.650 --> 13:52.250
First place

189
13:52.350 --> 13:53.980
is yours now.

190
14:07.560 --> 14:14.650
It may fade into the distance, yet it still reaches toward you.

191
14:14.830 --> 14:16.910
The sound of dawn,

192
14:17.160 --> 14:20.520
amid the stars that have quietly fallen into slumber.

193
14:20.770 --> 14:24.490
Even as it softly echoes...

194
14:28.980 --> 14:33.690
Dawn always comes softly,

195
14:33.900 --> 14:37.730
leaving secret tears behind.

196
14:39.670 --> 14:40.980
Hey.

197
14:41.600 --> 14:43.150
Let's take a picture.

198
14:43.830 --> 14:44.860
Look here.

199
14:46.000 --> 14:48.280
One, two, three!

200
14:50.420 --> 14:51.900
Look at the camera!

201
14:52.200 --> 14:54.560
Herod! One, two, three.

202
15:32.440 --> 15:36.710
[Saebyeok Entertainment: I like your voice. Reach out anytime!]

203
15:36.770 --> 15:38.260
[Head of Artist Development: Go Hyunwoo]

204
15:53.410 --> 15:54.920
Hello.

205
15:55.400 --> 15:57.650
I'm calling you on behalf of Lee Hanyul.

206
15:59.500 --> 16:01.560
I heard you left him a business card.

207
16:03.000 --> 16:05.400
Are you still interested in working with him?
